h("S2 Left/right-hand baseline re-implementation (acute dataset)")
L.append("Protocol as in the authors' MATLAB code: 29 channels, 50-Hz notch, 2nd-order Butterworth causal band-pass, MI period 0–4 s, random 24 train / 16 test per patient, 10 repetitions. `twfb_max` reproduces the public pipeline (one random split per candidate band, selection by test accuracy; `TWFB_DGFMDM.m` lines 43 and 113); `twfb_inner` selects the band within the training set. `_perm` = label permutation. The public `TSLDA_DGFMDM.m` (line 103) additionally selects between two classifiers by test accuracy; our `ts_lda` and `fgmdm` are reported separately and therefore do not correspond one-to-one to the paper's 61.20%. Our re-implementation differs from the original in band-pass ordering and the FBCSP sub-band flow; results illustrate the risk of test-set selection and are not a numerical reproduction of 55.57–72.21%.\n")
rows = []
for suf, lab in [("", "Q = 30"), ("_q6", "Q = 6 (original)")]:
    B = json.load(open(R / "stroke_baseline" / f"summary_rep10{suf}.json"))["summary"]
